<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 0.6 pct 2-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 0.6 pct 2-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday it was offering 120 billion yen worth of 0.6 percent two-year government notes through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 12 p.m. (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be January 20, 1997 and the maturity date will be January 20, 1999.</p>
